SUMMARY:Pittsburgh Irish Festival (35th Annual)
DTSTART:20260913T130000Z
DTEND:20260913T210000Z
LOCATION:Carrie Blast Furnaces\, 801 Carrie Furnace Blvd.\, Pittsburgh\, PA 15218
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Irish music\, dance\, food and culture at the 35th annual Pittsburgh Irish Festival\, a three-day event that returns to the Carrie Blast Furnaces with live performances\, cultural activities\, vendors and plenty of chances to explore Irish heritage in a historic Pittsburgh setting.\\n\\nhttps://pghirishfest.org/
URL:https://pghirishfest.org/
END:VEVENT
