DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, Sept. 19\, 2026\, Highmark Stadium will resound with the music of bands including the headliner Switchfoot\, as well as laughter\, games\, family fun\, service opportunities and worship during the inaugural FestPGH music and arts festival.\\n\\nhttps://festpgh.org/
